  "description": "An accident on the mountain leads one young man to a supernatural change! \n\nThere are stories about the Jang Mountain Tiger, a ghost that lures its prey by imitating humans before devouring them. Thankfully, it’s just a ghost story…right? Ever since Geon-Pil’s roommate, Yeon-Seung, returned from a trip up to Jang Mountain, something has seemed off. He’s used to Yeon-Seung’s moods—they’ve been roommates and then some for four years—but now the other man has a hunger unlike ever before. And when that insatiable appetite goes from food to something far more physical and feral, Geon-Pil is still drawn to “Yeon-Seung,” even as the danger increases. Will he be able to keep the beast at bay, or will Yeon-Seung devour him whole?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment, edited)",
